# Defend the Celestus divides three counters: two on Savannah Lions, one on
# Grizzly Bears (CR 601.2d). Human Bolts the Lions in response. CR 608.2b:
# the Lions are no longer a legal target, and their share goes with them --
# the Bears get only their own one counter, not the whole three
# (TargetChoices.java:71-82 drops the share with the target).
startturn ai
advance 3
tapformana ai 5 G
tapformana ai 6 G
tapformana ai 7 G
tapformana ai 8 G
tapformana human 10 R
queue targets 2,1
queue divide 2,1
queue targets 2
queue paygeneric G
queue paygeneric G
queue action ai cast 3
queue action human cast 9
passpriority
